  summary: The paper explicitly states the following limitations and unresolved questions regarding its study and results:

1. **Non-convergence of ADAM**: The authors demonstrate that ADAM can fail to converge to an optimal solution even in simple one-dimensional convex settings, contradicting the claims of convergence made by Kingma & Ba (2015) [convergence-adam_chunk_0017].

